            "review_title": "Review at Hoa Don Thanh Toan",
            "review_text": "Audrey E\nBerwick, Australia345 contributions\n0\nDisappointing food for a Michelin restaurant\nOct 2026 • Solo\nAdvertise their Mitchelin achievement but this only relates to a couple of dishes. I ordered the Seseme wrapped pork ribs with salted dry apricot sauce. It looked absolutely nothing like the menu photo (see attached). It was swimming in sauce. The sauce was overpowering and the ribs were tough and chewy. I think they just saw a tourist and could serve anythng. Very disappointing.\nRead more\nWritten October 7, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
