            "review_title": "Review at Hoa Don Thanh Toan",
            "review_text": "Berdier B\n5 contributions\n0\nFBA female, from Miami visiting HCMC, Good food, Good people👌🏽\nMay 2026 • Solo\nOMG!! My first trip to Vietnam, I'm solo traveling and was very intimidated by the food. I've never eaten Vietnamese food really had no idea what to eat. I never eat American food when I'm visiting another country but found myself in KFC and McDonald's, I never eat fast food in America. Anyway my new friend had eaten here many times and recommended this restaurant to me. Best Asian food I've ever! And I've been all over South East Asia. I think that I've found my food spot everything is so delicious!!! BYB\nRead more\nWritten May 6, 2026",
