            "review_title": "Review at Hoa Don Thanh Toan",
            "review_text": "BrisbaneTraveldoctor\nBrisbane, Australia459 contributions\n0\nAuthenticate food at great prices.\nDec 2025 • Couples\nStumbled on this place while walking around District 1. Nice little local restaurant selling Vietnamese dishes in both small & medium sizes - so you share a few if you like. The medium sizes are quite substantial.\n\nThe signature dish of seafood spring rolls is delicious. \n\nBeer was icy cold & prices very reasonable (not tourist prices). \n\nVerdict: Give it a shot.\nRead more\nWritten December 12, 2025",
